{
 "name": "Karoryfer Sneakybass (music-production build)",
 "comment": "A double bass played pizzicato, quietly, by Karoryfer Samples (Sneakybass), CC0 1.0: plucked with the finger (soft) and with more weight (loud) as two velocity layers with four round robins (0:32), muted notes (1:32) and ghost notes (2:32). Source: https://github.com/sfzinstruments/karoryfer.sneakybass at cc1a67e5c913678b85eaad1a3b5cb180d3be3e2d. Changes: pitch-checked against file names (a reading an octave off taken as the named note), small intonation offsets as fineTune, leading silence trimmed, levels matched per layer, 16-bit TPDF dither.",
 "copyright": "Source samples CC0-1.0",
 "target_rms": 0.08,
 "presets": [
  {
   "name": "Upright Bass",
   "program": 32,
   "layers": [
